  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING CLIMATE ACTIONS THROUGH TRANSPARENT FISHERIES MANGMNT IN SMALL ISL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to combat the degradation of marine resources and conserve the ocean&apos;s biodiversity in a manner that can also provide sustainable livelihoods for coastal communities in six African Small Island States.  It does this by strengthening sustainable fisheries management, putting in place national policies and strategies to promote the vital conservation of the marine resources and adapt to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
